data: {"id": "1ff4bc1b9f564afd-final", "run_id": "1ff4bc1b9f564afd", "seq": 872, "ts_ms": 1788824488773, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-11/workload` | Terminating | Pod aiops-case-11/workload 中存在自定义 finalizer 'aiops.lab/hold'。容器 app 因 SIGKILL (exitCode 137) 终止后，虽然 Kubelet 完成了资源清理并上报 Killing 事件，但由于该 finalizer 尚未被移除（对应的控制器可能缺失或未处理），API Server 阻止了 Pod 对象从 Etcd 中的彻底删除，导致 Pod 进入 Terminating 状态并卡住。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Normal Killing (31m ago): \"Stopping container app\" | 确认 Kubelet 已执行资源清理并上报事件 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod phase: Terminating (lasts 31m) | 确认 Pod 对象已停止运行但未能从 Etcd 彻底删除 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Container exit code: 137 (SIGKILL) | 确认容器因强制终止（OOMKilled 或手动 kill）而结束 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container restart count: 0 | 确认 Pod 仅发生过一次终止，未发生自动重启循环 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | container.resource_limit.memory: 96Mi | 为 exitCode 137 提供资源限制上下文 |\n\n**证据印证说明**：\nK8s 事件（#1）与状态（#2）均指向容器终止后的清理阶段，结合 Pod 状态卡住（Terminating 达 31 分钟），表明 Kubernetes 对象生命周期受阻。退出码 137（#3）证实了终止的直接触发原因，而 restart count 为 0（#4）排除了因配置错误导致的频繁崩溃重启（CrashLoopBackOff）作为根因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n自定义 finalizer 'aiops.lab/hold' 未被移除 → 容器 app 收到 SIGKILL (exitCode 137) 终止 → Kubelet 完成资源清理并上报 Killing 事件 → API Server 阻止 Pod 对象从 Etcd 彻底删除 → Pod 卡在 Terminating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **自定义 finalizer 'aiops.lab/hold' 阻止了 Pod 的删除**。\n\n证据显示容器 app 因 exit code 137（SIGKILL）终止 [证据 #3]，随后 Kubelet 完成了清理并上报了 Killing 事件 [证据 #1]。然而，Pod 对象状态显示其停留在 `Terminating` 阶段长达 31 分钟且未自动重启 [证据 #2, #4]。这表明 Kubernetes 的 Garbage Collector 在尝试删除 Pod 时被 finalizer 机制拦截，导致对象无法从 Etcd 中彻底移除。虽然资源限制（96Mi）存在，但根本机制在于 finalizer 的清除逻辑缺失。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 53.9s\n├─ 问题定位: 13.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 31.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 31.3s (Evidence 25.1s, RCA 6.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 53.899, "metrics": {"run_id": "1ff4bc1b9f564afd", "mttr": {"value": "53.9s", "seconds": 53.904924154281616, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 53904.924154281616, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 48725.69394111633, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 12973.239660263062, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4817.166090011597}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "dura